BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bloomington Chalk to the Ballot Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T170000
UID:cebb2c621b432633dea2589d4baadca0@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20Graphics%20%2811%29_20260526155003175190.png
DESCRIPTION:Monroe County Courthouse Lawn July 18\, 2026 6:00-8:00 pm ET J
 oin the ACLU-IN & community partners for a day of voter mobilization\, acc
 ess\, and education in preparation for the upcoming Midterm Elections. The
  presidential election is not the only time to earn an “I voted” stick
 er. Midterm elections\, when voters choose members of Congress\, state leg
 islators\, and governors\, are essential to meaningful representation and 
 the creation of state and local laws. These elections shape one-third of t
 he U.
LOCATION:Monroe County Courthouse\, 100 W Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, IN\
 , 47404
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/961161/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
