BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Indiana Activism Strategy Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T170000
UID:665399feedb26e0e3c4292414fef2d2b@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/June%2024%20strategy%20mobilize%20graphic_2026060321585627850
 5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive community workshop where we'll each
  share ideas\, identify what's working\, dream bigger\, and collectively m
 ap out priorities for Indivisible Central Indiana's next chapter. This is 
 a working session where your voice shapes the direction. This is open to l
 ongtime volunteers\, someone who's been curious from the sidelines\, or fr
 iends from partner organizations. Come ready to think\, talk\, and vote on
  ideas for how ICI can better align our work to the needs of the community
 .
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/966810/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Organizer Training Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T100000
UID:4cbd2ff0b1231df071ccb850c9a82eb8@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/orgtraining1_20260317202807543243.png
DESCRIPTION:Join the ACLU of Indiana's advocacy team for a series of in-de
 pth trainings on organizing. Learn how to build power in your community. G
 et the skills you need to take action in your own community. This training
  is designed for ACLU-IN volunteers\, but is open to all. These trainings 
 are virtual and happen every other month. Each training will cover a diffe
 rent topic and will teach distinct advocacy skills. The topics to be cover
 ed are: Legislative Advocacy (January)\, Canvassing (March)\, Phone Ban
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/854122/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
