DESCRIPTION:Join the ACLU and participate in a COUNTY-WIDE (Hamilton/Monro
 e/Brown/Jackson) Day of Get Out the Vote Chalking for the upcoming Mid-ter
 m elections. Date: Saturday\, July 18th\, 2026! Fill out the information b
 elow to host your own local chalking event on our Day of Chalk! Use this G
 oogle Form to sign up to host your own chalking event: https://forms.gle/5
 DmP9KXtMstCaikK7.
